∇ dst←{allow}Anonymise src;out;map;dup
 ⍝ Make a committed fixture (plus expected files) from raw Quest paste src.
 ⍝ allow: extra text you have checked is not personal data, if the
 ⍝ unrecognised-text check stops you.
 ⍝ Writes nothing unless every safety check in AnonymiseText passes.
  :If 900⌶⍬ ⋄ allow←⍬ ⋄ :EndIf
  (out map)←(⊆allow)AnonymiseText ReadRaw src
  :For dup :In Fixtures
      :If out≡ReadRaw dup ⋄ ('Already a fixture: ',dup)⎕SIGNAL 11 ⋄ :EndIf
  :EndFor
  3 ⎕MKDIR FixtureDir
  dst←(Describe out)FreePath 1
  out WriteRaw dst
  WriteExpected dst
  Say'Wrote ',dst,' (+ .json, .events): replaced the student and ',(⍕¯1+≢map),' instructor name(s)'
  Say'Check it yourself before committing:  diff ',src,' ',dst
∇
